          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga bubwami obwo bukhoole khu siakamo siabwo, mala bumayaanu bwoosi bube bukali bwoole khu siakamo siabwo, omwami mulala akheche ookhabe ne bunyindaafu lundi omukesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunyali bwewe buliba bukali. Alisaasia bubwonaki bukali lukali mala alitabusia buli nilio akhakhole. Akhabunie babaandu be kamaani kamakali ne babaandu ba Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bubacha bwewe ne bubeeyi, akhanyale khukhola lirekekha liewe liibi. Mala akheniinie. Akhabunie baandu bakali ne bakhamanyile tawe. Akhenye khu khuupana nende Omukhulu owe bakhulu, ne kakhali akhabunisibwe ne kamaani kakhali ko mundu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamalola ke akolooba ne kumutikhinyi kakenoosiibwe, kali ka ng'ali. Nono kakise sikila kalabukula siise sileeyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
